{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2023-03-24 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE JOINS RESPONSIBLESTEEL TO FURTHER SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS IN THE STEEL INDUSTRY', 'text': "FIRST SOFTWARE TECHNOLOGY PROVIDER TO JOIN INDUSTRY ORGANIZATION\xa0 WESTMINSTER, COLO. , MARCH 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS JOINED RESPONSIBLESTEEL, AN INDEPENDENT, NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION THAT IS THE STEEL INDUSTRY'S FIRST GLOBAL MULTI-STAKEHOLDER STANDARD AND CERTIFICATION INITIATIVE."}